  "status_text": "One set of readings can answer every budget question for a light as its switches turn on in order. Lean checked that under fixed gate limits, when alternating shows starting on and off have the same maximum of K flips, at most (K+2)q original readings preserve every weighted error test through the chosen limit (L-meta-53173). Here q is the minimum possible loss capped at one above that limit. The search can use the same selected readings at every loss budget through the limit.",
